# Type check for the signatures this repo ships under rbi/ (the SDK's and
# each provider gem's). script/ci runs it:
#
#   SRB_SKIP_GEM_RBIS=1 bundle exec srb tc
#
# Without SRB_SKIP_GEM_RBIS, `srb` also reads the signatures that other gems
# in the bundle ship, and reports their errors as well.
#
# lib/ is read without a `# typed:` sigil, so Sorbet checks that constants
# resolve and that a signature in rbi/ agrees with the method or class it
# describes when lib/ defines one (same parameters, same superclass). It
# does not check method bodies. sorbet/usage/ holds strictly typed callers
# of the hand-maintained signatures, so the types those callers use are
# checked too; sorbet/rbi/ holds stand-ins for other gems' constants.
#
# Two mistakes still pass: a signature for a method that lib/ no longer
# defines, and a wrong type on a signature that sorbet/usage/ never calls.
--dir=lib
--dir=rbi
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-aws/lib
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-aws/rbi
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-gcp/lib
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-gcp/rbi
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-github-actions/lib
--dir=gems/workos-workload-identity-github-actions/rbi
--dir=sorbet

# Known errors in generated files. They cannot be fixed in this repo; the
# fix belongs in the generator (workos/oagen-emitters). Remove each line
# once a regeneration makes it unnecessary.
#
# When a regeneration brings a new error in a generated file, this check
# fails on that pull request. Fix the generator, or add an `--ignore` line
# here for that one .rbi file (the path after rbi/, with a leading slash)
# and say why.
#
# 4022: an alias model is `Alias = Original` in lib/ and a full `class
# Alias` in rbi/ (106 files).
--suppress-error-code=4022
# The signatures of add_organization_role_permission and
# add_environment_role_permission lack the `body_slug:` keyword that the
# methods require.
--ignore=/workos/authorization.rbi
# Three result classes are declared as T::Struct; in lib/ they are Struct.
# The file has the generated header, so it is not edited here, although it
# describes a hand-maintained class and the generator no longer writes it.
--ignore=/workos/session_manager.rbi
